    {
      "name": "@fuxi-ailabs/workflow-rsi-dsh-console",
      "title": {
        "en": "workflow-rsi Console",
        "zh": "workflow-rsi 操作台"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Recursive self-improvement for ToD (to Developer) static workflows, whose stages, nodes and hand-offs are fixed per release: without touching model weights, workflow-rsi uses real run results to search, evaluate and publish better Workflow structures, and improves its own improvement methods. Candidates are judged on the whole Workflow by human-admitted evaluation assets and delivered as PRs. This DSH console requires wrsi-server from @fuxi-ailabs/workflow-rsi.",
        "zh": "workflow-rsi 让 ToD（to Developer，面向开发者）的静态工作流递归自我改进（静态工作流：阶段、节点与交接随版本固定，每个输入按同一张结构图执行）：不改模型权重，用真实运行结果持续搜索、评测并发布更好的 Workflow 结构，并改进自己的改进方法。候选在整个 Workflow 上由人准入的评测资产判定，以 PR 交付。需要 @fuxi-ailabs/workflow-rsi 提供的 wrsi-server。"
      },
      "icon": "icons/workflow-rsi.svg",
      "author": "cacheline",
      "homepage": "https://fuxi-ailabs.github.io/dsh-plugin-market/plugins/workflow-rsi/",
      "metadata": {
        "category": "workflow",
        "keywords": [
          "workflow-rsi",
          "workflow",
          "evaluation",
          "RSI",
          "工作流",
          "评测",
          "闭环"
        ]
