    {
      "name": "@fuxi-ailabs/dsh-ecat",
      "title": {
        "en": "ECAT",
        "zh": "ECAT熵减对抗优化器"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Adversarial entropy reduction loop optimization configured and running in DSH: Interview based design scoring dimension, generator and discriminator adversarial verification implementation, backend iteration and can be viewed and stopped at any time, suitable for long-range tasks with clear acceptance goals, such as large-scale code repository cross end migration, etc.",
        "zh": "在 DSH 中配置并运行的对抗式降熵循环优化：访谈式设计评分维度，生成器和判别器对抗验证实现，后台迭代并可随时查看与停止，适用于有明确验收目标的长程任务，比如大规模代码仓跨端迁移等。"
      },
      "icon": "icons/ecat.svg",
      "author": "Fuxi AI Labs",
      "homepage": "https://fuxi-ailabs.github.io/dsh-plugin-market/plugins/ecat/",
